.TH PRODBOX_status 1
.SH NAME
prodbox-status \- Observe local control and current lifecycle admission
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodbox status
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the selected deployment's local control and Authority journal. Reports unavailable dependencies, the journal source and the next deletion action.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBprodbox status\fR
View lifecycle and local control observations.
